                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/122–1348: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The consul General at Taipei</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Krentz</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Taipei</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-12-13T16:00:00+08:00">December 13, 1948—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 13—5 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. For Butterworth. Information Deptel 68 regarding munitions already known
                    locally causing speculation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Krentz</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
